  "content": "<!-- Header Section End -->\n\n            <!-- Content Wrapper Start -->\n            <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n\n                <!-- Breadcrumb Start -->\n                <div class=\"breadcrumb-wrap bg-f br-1\">\n                    <div class=\"container\">\n                        <div class=\"breadcrumb-title\">\n                            <h2>Make Donation</h2>\n                            <ul class=\"breadcrumb-menu list-style\">\n                                <li><a href=\"/\">Home </a></li>\n                                <li>Donation</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <!-- Breadcrumb End -->\n\n                <!-- Donation section Start -->\n                <section class=\"project-details-wrap ptb-100\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row gx-5\">\n            <div class=\"col-xl-8\">\n                <div class=\"project-desc\">\n                    <a class=\"single-project-img mt-0\" data-fancybox=\"gallery\" href=\"assets/img/project/single-donation-1.jpg\">\n                        <img src=\"/assets/img/project/wild-life.jpg\" alt=\"Image\">\n                    </a>\n                    <h2>Save The Wildlife With Your Donation </h2>\n                    <div class=\"progressbar-wrap\">\n                        <div class=\"progress-bar\" data-percentage=\"4%\">\n                            <h4 class=\"progress-title-holder\">\n                                <span class=\"progress-number-wrapper\">\n                                    <span class=\"progress-number-mark\">\n                                        <span class=\"percent\">4%</span>\n                                    </span>\n                                </span>\n                            </h4>\n                            <div class=\"progress-content-outter\">\n                                <div class=\"progress-content\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <ul class=\"fund-collection list-style\">\n                        <li class=\"fund-raised\">\n                            <span id=\"raisedAmount\">$10</span> Raised Of $19000\n                        </li>\n                    </ul>\n\n                    <p>We believe in the power of collective action to combat climate change. Our commitment to a sustainable future is fueled by our passion for the planet and our unwavering dedication to positive change.</p>\n                    <p>Every tree we plant is a symbol of hope for a greener tomorrow. With your support, we've already made significant strides in reforestation, but there's so much more to be done. Your donation can help us plant trees, restore ecosystems, and create a healthier world for generations to come.</p>\n                    <p>We invite you to be a part of our journey. Your donation, no matter the size, fuels our efforts and magnifies our impact. Together, we can combat climate change, protect our planet's biodiversity, and secure a sustainable future for all.</p>\n\n                    <form action=\"#\" class=\"donation-form\">\n                        <h2>Donation Information</h2>\n                        <p>I would like to make a donation in the amount of</p>\n                        <!-- Commented out radio buttons for brevity -->\n                        <!--\n                        <div class=\"radionbtn-wrap\">\n                            <div class=\"radionbtn\">\n                                <input type=\"radio\" id=\"test1\" name=\"radio-group\" checked>\n                                <label for=\"test1\">$1000</label>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"radionbtn\">\n                                <input type=\"radio\" id=\"test2\" name=\"radio-group\">\n                                <label for=\"test2\">$500</label>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"radionbtn\">\n                                <input type=\"radio\" id=\"test3\" name=\"radio-group\">\n                                <label for=\"test3\">$100</label>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"radionbtn\">\n                                <input type=\"radio\" id=\"test4\" name=\"radio-group\">\n                                <label for=\"test4\">$50</label>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"radionbtn\">\n                                <input type=\"radio\" id=\"test5\" name=\"radio-group\">\n                                <label for=\"test5\">Others</label>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        -->\n                        <!--\n                        <div class=\"form-check checkbox\">\n                            <input class=\"form-check-input\" type=\"checkbox\" id=\"test_2\">\n                            <label class=\"form-check-label\" for=\"test_2\">\n                                I would like this donation to automatically repeat each month.\n                            </label>\n                        </div>\n                        -->\n                       \n                        <div class=\"row\">\n                            <!-- Form fields code here -->\n\n                            <!--\n                            <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                                <div class=\"form-check checkbox\">\n                                    <input class=\"form-check-input\" type=\"checkbox\" id=\"test_3\">\n                                    <label class=\"form-check-label\" for=\"test_3\">\n                                        Add me to your mailing list\n                                    </label>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            -->\n                            <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                                <div class=\"form-check checkbox\">\n                                    <input class=\"form-check-input\" type=\"checkbox\" id=\"test_4\">\n                                    <label class=\"form-check-label\" for=\"test_4\">\n                                        Please do not publish my name. I would like to remain anonymous.\n                                    </label>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"form-group\">\n                                <label for=\"custom-amount\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px;\">Enter Custom Amount: Currency is $</label>\n                                <input type=\"number\" id=\"custom-amount\" placeholder=\"Enter amount\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                                <!-- PayPal button container -->\n                                <div id=\"paypal-button-container\"></div>\n                                <!-- Your existing button -->\n                                <!-- <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn style1\">Donate Now</button> -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </form>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-xl-4\">\n                <div class=\"sidebar\">\n                    <div class=\"sidebar-widget\">\n                        <h4>Search</h4>\n                        <div class=\"search-box\">\n                            <div class=\"form-group\">\n                                <input type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Search\">\n                                <button type=\"submit\">\n                                    <i class=\"flaticon-search\"></i>\n                                </button>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"sidebar-widget\">\n                        <h4>Give Us A Message</h4>\n                        <form action=\"process_form.php\" class=\"register-widget\" method=\"post\">\n                            <div class=\"form-group\">\n                                <input type=\"text\" name=\"custom_name\" placeholder=\"Name\" requird>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"form-group\">\n                                <input type=\"email\" name=\"custom_email\" placeholder=\"Email*\" required>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"form-group\">\n                                <input type=\"phone\" name=\"number\" placeholder=\"Phone*\" required>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"form-group\">\n                                <input type=\"text\" name=\"subject\" placeholder=\"Subject\" required>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"form-group\">\n                                <textarea name=\"msg\" id=\"msg\" cols=\"30\" rows=\"10\" placeholder=\"Your Message\" required ></textarea>\n                            </div>\n                            <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn style1 w-100 d-block\">Send Message</button>\n                        </form>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    \n</section>\n\n                <!-- Event Details section End -->\n\n            \n            <!-- Content wrapper end -->\n\n           <!-- Footer Section Start -->"
